  "query_preview": "(Friday through Monday)...\nA low pressure system moving into the western states will bring a\ncooling trend for Friday through Sunday, continuing into the\ndeserts on Monday as the coast and valleys begin to warm. High\ntemperatures on Sunday will be a few degrees below average to\naround 5 degrees below average for the inland valleys. High\ntemperatures on Sunday will range from around 70 near the coast \nto the upper 70s to mid 80s for the Inland Empire with the lower \ndeserts around 100. Night and morning coastal low clouds will \nspread farther into the valleys late each night as the marine \nlayer deepens.",
